ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah for Debian
-----------------------------------

This is the regular version of the intro, not the minimised 4k party
version. It is built with the USE_LD definition, so the executable is
linked normally against the system libraries (SDL2, GLEW, libpng, Boost)
instead of loading them at runtime with the dnload mechanism.

The fragment shader is read from /usr/share/ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah.

Changes made for the Debian package (see debian/patches):
 - CMake 3.16 build with the imported targets of the system libraries,
   the executable is named after the package;
 - SDL2 include paths;
 - no rpath in the executable;
 - shader path moved to /usr/share/ghostsofmars-by-faemiyah;
 - F toggles fullscreen (desktop resolution), the window is resizable;
 - V-Sync is enabled.

The prebuilt party binaries of the rel/ directory (FreeBSD, Linux,
Windows) are kept in the source package as shipped upstream, but are not
installed.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

